OL,3,GNEWSAKnife surrender encouraged during
OL,4,Anational campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has joined others across
OL,7,Fthe county for a week-long initiative
OL,8,Fto educate the public against the
OL,9,Fdangers of knife carrying.
OL,11,FAs part of the Sceptre campaign, which
OL,12,Fruns from 16 to 22 November, Dorset
OL,13,FPolice officers will be carrying out
OL,14,Fweapons sweeps in "hot spots"
OL,15,Fidentified by intelligence, engaging
OL,16,Fwith retailers on the responsible
OL,17,Fselling of knives and hosting public
OL,18,Fengagement events.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
