OL,3,GNEWSAKnife surrender encouraged during
OL,4,Anational campaign
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Sceptre campaign is led by the
OL,7,FNational Police Chiefs' Council (NPCC),
OL,8,Fwhich provides guidance on selling
OL,9,Fknives.
OL,11,FDet Supt Andy Bell, Dorset Police's
OL,12,Fknife crime lead, said that even though
OL,13,Fthe county had low rates of knife
OL,14,Fcrime, "we must acknowledge that
OL,15,Fincidents do occur".
